{
    "namespace": "kabegame",
    "name": "gallery_aspect_router",
    "note": "Filter by aspect ratio (width / height). Not listable: write the segment directly. Ratios are written <w>x<h> with positive integers; ranges are left-open and right-closed, so adjacent ranges never overlap. -9x16 = at most 9:16; 9x16-3x4 = above 9:16 and at most 3:4; 7x3- = above 7:3; unknown = width or height missing or not positive. The app's buckets are -3x4 (portrait), 3x4-4x3 (square-ish), 4x3-16x9 (landscape), 16x9- (widescreen) and unknown. The legacy dimension and dimensions entry points are aliases of aspect.",
    // 不提供 list：段值是任意比值区间，没有可枚举的全集；前端与 VD 各自持有固定的桶表。
    // 四种段型对应 aspect_range_provider 的上下界：缺下界补 0x1，缺上界补 1x0（∞），见该 provider 注释。
    "resolve": {
        "-([1-9][0-9]*)x([1-9][0-9]*)": {
            "provider": "gallery_aspect_bucket_router",
            "properties": { "min_w": 0, "min_h": 1, "max_w": "${capture[1]}", "max_h": "${capture[2]}" }
        },
        "([1-9][0-9]*)x([1-9][0-9]*)-([1-9][0-9]*)x([1-9][0-9]*)": {
            "provider": "gallery_aspect_bucket_router",
            "properties": {
                "min_w": "${capture[1]}",
                "min_h": "${capture[2]}",
                "max_w": "${capture[3]}",
                "max_h": "${capture[4]}"
            }
        },
        "([1-9][0-9]*)x([1-9][0-9]*)-": {
            "provider": "gallery_aspect_bucket_router",
            "properties": { "min_w": "${capture[1]}", "min_h": "${capture[2]}", "max_w": 1, "max_h": 0 }
        },
        "unknown": {
            "provider": "gallery_aspect_unknown_router"
        }
    }
}
